{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19944","headline":"石淙 八 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屑珠泻潺湲，裂玉何威瓌。\n若调千瑟弦，未果一曲谐。\n古骇毛发栗，险惊视听乖。\n二老皆劲骨，风趋缘欹崖。\n地远有余美，我游采弃怀。\n乘时幸勤鉴，前恨多幽霾。\n弱力谢刚健，蹇策贵安排。\n始知随事静，何必当夕斋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}